{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-193047-r4525004","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Paneer Butter Masala","sourcePageId":193047,"sourceRevision":"4525004","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-18T18:47:20Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Paneer%20Butter%20Masala&oldid=4525004","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:20:09.094Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Indian recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using asafoetida","Category:Recipes using cardamom","Category:Recipes using clarified butter","Category:Recipes using cumin","Category:Recipes using garam masala","Category:Recipes using ginger paste","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using paneer","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"1b52f7dd1c5898a514632a6e97f70c96ec4c2443cff2e105c828950c7770c7b2","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Indian recipes|servings=2|time=25 minutes|difficulty=2}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of India|Indian Cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Vegetarian cuisine|Vegetarian]]\n\n'''Paneer butter masala''' also known as '''paneer makhani''' is a vegetarian dish from [[Cookbook:Cuisine of India|India]] that is also popular in the west. The dish combines [[Cookbook:Paneer|paneer]] in a sauce quite similar to that of butter chicken.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* [[Cookbook:Clarified Butter|Ghee]] or [[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|oil]]\n* 200 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Paneer|paneer]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]] paste\n* 5 tsp [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] paste\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Capsicum|capsicum]], diced\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]], diced\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Ghee|ghee]]\n* 5 tsp [[Cookbook:Asafoetida|hing]] powder\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Cardamom|cardamom]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Turmeric|turmeric]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Garam Masala|garam masala]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Chilli Powder|chilli powder]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Cumin|cumin]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* 500 g natural (plain) [[Cookbook:Yoghurt|yoghurt]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#[[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] paneer in ghee or oil, and set aside in a bowl.\n#[[Cookbook:Sautéing|Sauté]] onion in oil with garlic and ginger paste until golden brown.\n#Add diced capsicum and tomatoes.\n#In a separate pan combine ghee, hing, cardamom, turmeric, garam masala, chilli powder, lemon juice, and cumin.\n#Fry for 2 minutes, then add yoghurt.\n#Cook on medium heat for five minutes.\n#Add onions, capsicum, tomatoes, and paneer.\n#Cook on low heat for 15 minutes occasionally stirring.\n#Serve with [[Cookbook:roti|rotis]] or [[Cookbook:naan|naan]] and [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]].\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* For more of a gravy-like texture reduce the amount of yoghurt and add full-fat [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]] with a spoonful of [[Cookbook:Cornstarch|cornstarch]] as desired.\n\n[[Category:Indian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paneer]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using asafoetida]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clarified butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cardamom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garam masala]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ginger paste]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cumin]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Paneer Butter Masala","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Ghee or oil","sourceText":"Ghee or oil","amountText":"Ghee or oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"200 g paneer","sourceText":"200 g paneer","amountText":"200 g paneer","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 onion, diced","sourceText":"1 onion, diced","amountText":"1 onion, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tsp ginger paste","sourceText":"1 tsp ginger paste","amountText":"1 tsp ginger paste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"5 tsp garlic paste","sourceText":"5 tsp garlic paste","amountText":"5 tsp garlic paste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 capsicum, diced","sourceText":"1 capsicum, diced","amountText":"1 capsicum, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"2 tomatoes, diced","sourceText":"2 tomatoes, diced","amountText":"2 tomatoes, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 tsp ghee","sourceText":"1 tsp ghee","amountText":"1 tsp ghee","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"5 tsp hing powder","sourceText":"5 tsp hing powder","amountText":"5 tsp hing powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"1 tsp cardamom","sourceText":"1 tsp cardamom","amountText":"1 tsp cardamom","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"1 tsp turmeric","sourceText":"1 tsp turmeric","amountText":"1 tsp turmeric","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-12","name":"1 tsp garam masala","sourceText":"1 tsp garam masala","amountText":"1 tsp garam